d, 47 witness_note, 6 poll_failed, 2 meta_wipe_recovery, 2 first_poll, 0 canon_changed", "workspace_status": "NAS mount 100% full, 0 bytes avail; /workspace/repos/ai-writings/... absent; recovered via blobless clone to overlay /tmp then staged to /tmp/wm-run (27th wipe)", "open_defect": "bookkeeper budget=1000.0 vs gamma+eta=70.0; (0,0) escape clause AST-proven UNREACHABLE on all call paths (0 literal (0.0,0.0) call sites), so last_conserved is False everywhere and carries no signal"}, "hash": "588de32a345ad273"}
